<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Telecom falls 1.26 pct.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Telecom falls 1.26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan Telecommunication Company Ltd (PTCL) 10-rupee stock fell 0.40 rupees, or 1.26 percent, to 31.25 on Tuesday's settlement day on profit-taking, dealers at the Karachi Stock Exchange (KSE) said.</p>
<p>Some 3.8 million shares changed hands in early trade as jobbers squared their position and booked profit, one dealer of Taurus Securities said.</p>
<p>-- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
